  "description": "A mid‑poly 3D model of the classic Nintendo GameCube console, built with clean hard‑surface topology and accurate proportions.\nDesigned for real‑time use in engines like Unity, Unreal, and VRChat, with enough detail to hold up in close‑up shots without being overly dense.\n\n**Features:**\nAccurate controller ports, memory card slots, and top‑lid detailing\nIdeal for retro environments, game props, or showcase renders\nSuitable for real‑time engines and mid‑poly workflows",
